## Freemium / dual licensing model

The base VoodBuilder package provides a free (Community) edition suitable for
building and publishing public sites with the visual page editor, themes, and
core Filament admin surfaces.

Paid companion plugins and/or a commercial subscription unlock extended
capabilities (for example Elements, Components, Dynamic Data, Templates,
Analytics, and other Agency/Enterprise features). Those companions are licensed
separately under their own commercial terms.

## Use

You may use, install, and modify this package only under a valid license
agreement with Voodflow appropriate to your edition (free base and/or paid
companions/subscription). Unauthorized copying, distribution, sublicensing, or
public disclosure of proprietary source beyond the rights granted by your
license is prohibited.

For licensing inquiries, contact Voodflow.
